{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視（TVB）真人騷《中年好聲音4》今晚（8月23日）晚上7時30分於翡翠台現場直播總決賽《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》，終極7強名單包括：鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、尹景順、吳亦偉、許雲妮、尤淑情及許美琪。</p><p>以下立即為大家帶來即時戰況！</p><p>鄭家聲《海闊天空》90分</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289234105143296587962.jpeg/453J-B5J6qnyzN5I1Z4zOe2tzAyRPTvaS0Z81UtGfNU\"/><p>蔡宓婕《美麗之最》91分</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289287775457280712983.jpeg/Cg5jcZyGS3ewYGKWkpyWRVHi5szdqWAsuq1UmLqtVJg\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T12:18:54.878899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":2,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}